+SIG: `blazer-nfc: core generic error ntf` during stage 4 → RF needs ST config/clock (OPEN)
+SIG: haptic `tap N rc 16` while blazer-nfc runs → EBUSY by design (the cli10 bus lock), the tap is skipped
